# 🚀 Building CRUD API with Go and MySQL

## 📖 What is CRUD?

CRUD stands for:

| Operation | HTTP Method |
| --------- | ----------- |
| Create    | POST        |
| Read      | GET         |
| Update    | PUT         |
| Delete    | DELETE      |

CRUD APIs are widely used in:

* Student Management System
* Hospital Management System
* Employee Management System
* E-Commerce Applications

---

# 🎯 Project: Student Management API

We will build APIs for:

```text
POST    /students
GET     /students
GET     /student/{id}
PUT     /student/{id}
DELETE  /student/{id}
```

